{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e98d6a1f-1ec6-8a46-ad20-2450c3da01b4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T09:31:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maureen Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:29:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:29:04-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Denise. This is Maureen Brennan. I'm calling about my recycling. So, last Tuesday I put the bin out like always, and it didn't get picked up, and then Wednesday morning I went out and there was a tag stuck on the lid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:29:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What did the tag say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:29:24-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It said rejected. That's the word on it, rejected, with a box checked off, but I can't tell which box, the print is small. Then I left it there through the weekend thinking maybe they'd come back, and nobody did. And yesterday I brought it in and took a look inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:29:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And what was in it, do you know? Usually that tag means something in there didn't belong, like bags or food waste."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there were some plastic bags, I'll admit, with the bottles inside them. Oh, hold on. [pause] No, honey, that's not a toy. Sorry, I have my grandson here, he's grabbing for the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:30:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:30:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I've got it up high now. So, yes, the bags. Is there a fee for this? Do I get charged for them rejecting it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:30:18-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, there's no fee for a rejected bin. They just leave the tag so you know to fix it. Take the bottles and cans out of the bags, put them in loose, and the bags go in your regular trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:30:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Loose, not bagged. Alright. And then do I just put it out on my next day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:30:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, next scheduled pickup. What's the address, so I can note it on the route?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:30:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 80 Bridge Street, down on the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:30:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "80 Bridge Street. Got it. I'll note that the bin was tagged and that you've been told what to change. Do you rent there, or own?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. The landlord's downstairs, but the bin is mine to deal with."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Just make sure the lid closes and nothing's piled on top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:31:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lid closes. Okay. Oh, he's got the cord now. Hang on. [pause] Alright, I'm back. Is that everything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:31:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's everything. With the holiday week the schedule may shift a day, so check the calendar on the city website or the one you got in the mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll look at the calendar. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:31:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Maureen. Happy New Year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:31:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same to you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
